<script setup lang="ts">import {percent} from '../utils/format';defineProps<{result:any}>();function entryFor(result:any,name:string){return (result.category_entries||[]).find((e:any)=>e.name===name)}</script><template><aside class="category-margins"><small>EMPIRICAL CATEGORY MARGINALS</small><h2>类别基率，<br/>是κ的另一半。</h2><div class="margin-row" v-for="(c,i) in result.categories" :key="c"><div><strong>{{c}} <small class="code-chip">{{entryFor(result,c)?.code||'未编码'}}</small></strong><span>{{result.category_totals[i]}}票 / {{percent(result.category_prevalence[i])}}</span></div><div class="margin-track"><span :class="'category-'+i" :style="{width:result.category_prevalence[i]*100+'%'}"></span></div></div><p>Pe = Σpⱼ²。类别失衡会改变机会基线，κ不能替代逐项一致和类别占比。</p><p>面板：{{result.raters.join(' / ')}} · 名称语言 {{result.category_locale||'zh-CN'}}</p></aside></template>
